{"server":"tw","storyId":"act28side_level_act28side_st01","groupId":"act28side","stageId":"act28side_st01","title":"火線之中","storyCode":"CV-ST-1","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"4e2f957fb6d00f9401cf175370168ec5d11f44f772c1eaceae7bb3373e58bf94","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_9"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g1_mine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——這鬼天氣怎麼這麼冷！我就不明白了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它怎麼就能這麼冷，能他媽這麼冷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"趕緊進來吧！既然知道冷，還站在餐館門口抱怨天氣幹什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g3_diner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這是不想把地給踩髒了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說得好像你能把雪跺乾淨似的……給你，熱茶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……好燙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……今天餐館的地也夠髒的，早知道我就直接進來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雪下得這麼大，只要來個人就會踩髒，打烊之後我會再擦一遍的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要來點什麼，豆子還是乾麵包？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也算選擇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這些，不想吃你也可以不吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能都來點嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，看在你是今晚光顧的第一個正經人，我再給你來點免費的奶油。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海倫娜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這怎麼連椅子上也都是泥水——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你們兩個，這不是你家，把腳給我放下來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老東西，你跟誰說話呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……你們冷靜些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗魯的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不關你的事，老闆娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這樣，都是來吃口熱飯的，有什麼話好好說嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，老闆娘，你這麼護著他啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬥個嘴而已，不至於要拿刀吧，你說呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴，否則我連你一起捅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海倫娜，不用你管，這群混帳我可得好好教育下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你找死！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"混混拿著刀正想上前，一把餐刀從對面飛來，穩穩扎在他的腳邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要再上前了，小朋友。夜深了，還是快回家找媽媽去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你這女人非要——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不等混混挪步，第二把餐刀便擦過他的臉頰，扎在他背後的牆上。\n幾滴鮮血落在他腳邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的耳朵？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還在你的腦袋上呢，擔心什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你要是再不走，就真的說不準了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"老闆娘轉身取下架子上的抹布，開始細細擦拭吧檯。\n指間還夾著另一把餐刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蠻橫的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗魯的混混","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算了算了，咱們走，以後有的是機會找他們算帳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿去，你的餐上齊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呦，好燙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來一次餐廳燙兩次舌頭，這裡也只有你做得出這種事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一整天沒坐下來吃東西了，心急嘛。先不說這些，海倫娜，鎮子上的混帳東西是不是越來越多了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是伍德洛出去找人，他們覺得沒人能鎮得住自己了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼……不過邁爾斯也真是的，一聲不吭就跑去地塊外找燃料，最後不見蹤影還得伍德洛去找他，只會找麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地塊上燃料緊缺，他也是沒有辦法。再說，不管邁爾斯遇上了什麼，人還是動物，伍德洛都能在三秒鐘內把那東西打成篩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可萬一伍德洛去晚了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，少說兩句，乖乖吃你的燉豆子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我就是擔心……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海倫娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，這是最後一點奶油了，能不能把你的嘴堵上？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慵懶的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友們，睡醒了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慵懶的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"樹林裡可能有埋伏，先遣小隊已經去偵測了。要是他們需要武力支援，我們可不好坐在載具裡乾等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再慵懶的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以勞駕，抬抬屁股，拿起自己的裝備，掩護好自己，數一二三。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再慵懶的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呦，我的眼睛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陽光從雪地上反射回來，有點刺眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我應該提醒過你在雪原上作戰的注意事項，墨鏡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒你想得那麼周到，只好先用手頭的東西湊合一下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面情況到底如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"少安勿躁，情況稍微有些棘手。這裡的積雪太厚了，敵人掩藏在裡面不好找，確切標記他們的位置要花點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，出發之前只說任務是來修動力爐，現在又多了清剿流匪……就當是順手替地塊做好事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友們，你們說呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已準備就緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的部下們可都等不及要突擊了，隊長。現在我們能和達維鎮長官取得聯繫嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們回覆說會派遣人員在地塊入口接應我們，但是地塊外的戰鬥支援，他們愛莫能助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，好感激他們啊，我好怕會在鎮子裡迷路呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"達維鎮僅僅是一個幾近破產的採礦地塊，我們很難提更多要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"年初他們就向州政府報告了當地動力爐爆炸引發的燃料洩漏事件，但誰也沒空管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然他們自己應對得不錯，沒造成大範圍污染，但動力爐的損壞難以修復，當地沒人能處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，年初的事情，為什麼年末才找到我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小地方財政捉襟見肘，事情不拖到拖不下去，絕不會在上面花錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那時動力爐應該還能勉強維持平台的移動，幾個月前徹底癱瘓，現在恐怕連最基本的供暖功能也難以保障。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在零下十四度啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到夜裡還會降溫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就沒有好消息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"地圖顯示達維鎮就在前面，穿過那片林子就能看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再來一條怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……正好，任務目標已經全部鎖定，可以執行清剿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接戰之前最後問一句，潔西卡和羅拉呢？你把她倆派去哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敵方營地。有一位當地居民被扣押在那裡，留守的人不多，不宜派遣太多人營救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，知道了，我會盡快結束戰鬥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殘忍的雪地匪幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，老東西，你被吊了一個小時了，渴不渴？要不要喝水？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殘忍的雪地匪幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不說話，那就是想喝囉？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殘忍的雪地匪幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（從地上抓起一捧雪）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殘忍的雪地匪幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，讓你喝個夠，別謝我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘔……咳咳……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"求你放了我，我身上什麼都沒有……咳、咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殘忍的雪地匪幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼呢。雪地裡這麼無聊，好不容易遇上你，才算有點樂子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的雪地匪幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別瞎搞了，趕緊把他解決掉，我想清淨清淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殘忍的雪地匪幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦，老東西，你吵到我朋友了，接下來你可別再出聲了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的雪地匪幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……奇葩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殘忍的雪地匪幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都去埋伏那列車隊了，留我們幾個在這裡看守營地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殘忍的雪地匪幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等他們回來，背包裡裝得滿滿的，只丟幾件破爛打發我們。你這還能坐得住？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的雪地匪幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖……你不願意的話，那我來好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你要做什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的雪地匪幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安靜，我是幫你解脫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的雪地匪幫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殘忍的雪地匪幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……你是誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼幹員","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓！老伯，別出聲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼幹員","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我幫你把身上的繩子解開。一路上跟緊我，保持冷靜。能做到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鋼幹員","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是羅拉。人質已經救出，你那邊怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都處理完了，就是我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡，你受傷了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不、不是……是我的通訊器壞……嗶滋……我自己能處理，沒問題……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗶滋……謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡，你不用跟我說謝謝的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗶滋……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先送人質到集合地點，一會見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗶滋……一會見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑抗的雪地暴徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你拼了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從正面送上來，大哥你真是勇氣可嘉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"頑抗的雪地暴徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一個了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報告隊長，所有目標已清空。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通訊音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好的，我們也正在回撤，預計幾分鐘後可以會合，繼續等待潔西卡和羅拉——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂、喂？你那邊發生什麼了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近到這個距離，我們應該沒必要再用通訊器了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你非得來這麼一下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"某人說過，有時候逗逗別人能緩解戰鬥後的緊張情緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你學壞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她教得好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這天氣真是說變就變……剛剛還好好的，這就起霧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁爾斯先生，其他的傷我們都處理好了。腹部的瘀傷看起來沒有大礙，但我還是建議你回去之後去醫院檢查一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫院？……達維鎮的醫院很早就沒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……正好我們的目的地也是達維鎮，順便送你回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們去達維鎮做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁爾斯先生，放輕鬆。我們此次前來的任務就是幫助地塊重新啟動運行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們帶了一些物資和燃料，這些東西足夠讓居民們再撐一段時間，直到我們修好動力爐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可……你們帶技術員了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"動力爐早就快不行了。沒有技術員，一旦動力爐徹底熄火，地塊上的人熬不過這冷死人的鬼天氣的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜點，邁爾斯先生，我就是小隊的首席技術員。叫我羅拉就好，很高興認識你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……達維鎮的鍋爐工，邁爾斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝……謝謝……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"邁爾斯先生，你為什麼要離開地塊？這附近很危險的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"邁爾斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地塊上幾乎找不到任何燃料了，我出來碰碰運氣……既然你們是來修動力爐的，我們可以盡快出發嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等下，讓我問問潔西卡在哪裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，潔西卡？這裡是羅拉。忙完了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗶滋……已經全部處理完——嗶滋……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你趕緊過來——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂？潔西卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅拉","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡？？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅拉，你們在哪，我這就過去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅拉？喂？喂？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊器怎麼偏偏在這個時候壞了啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我看看座標……營地呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這周圍怎麼連一個標誌物都沒有……我現在到底在哪裡？我該不會迷路了吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜，冷靜……你現在在達維鎮外圍，距離地塊不遠……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……只能先等風停了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……好冷啊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘆口氣，潔西卡將手放進口袋裡。\n她的手指觸到了口袋的絲絨袋子，還有袋子裡小小的硬物。\n拿出袋子，她把裡面的東西倒了出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g9_modernoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報告。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼是你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷蛇隊長在回程途中遇到強烈風暴，暫時沒法回到本艦，所以我來代她述職。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你收到去達維鎮的任務通知了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任務內容呢？你了解過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們將前往達維鎮，一座發展出了小型居民區的採礦平台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平台目前因為動力爐爆炸事故擱淺在哥倫比亞的東部林帶中，此次任務目標是修理動力爐，恢復地塊行駛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，我記得材料是今天才下發的。那後續安排呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任務指令只講到這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了……告訴你也無妨，等到達維鎮回到原本的航線上後，巴倫基地會在那裡等，將其拖拽去往附近的移動城市進行合併與回收。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您為什麼和我講這些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡，從維多利亞回來後，你的工作態度沒有以前那麼積極了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……克里夫先生，我不明白為什麼會得到這樣的評價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在盡力完成被分配到的任務，而我負責的任務目標……也都達成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在上個月，你試圖拒絕撤離源石塵污染區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時附近有人需要救援……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半年前，一次突擊行動中，你違抗了上級的指令，執意選擇遠離居民區的路線行進，險些讓整個小隊捲進不必要的戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本的方案會對當地居民造成很大傷害……我、我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而一年前，你剛從維多利亞回到巴倫基地，就衝進了指揮部。如果不是沒帶銃，我還以為你要叛變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很、很抱歉，克里夫先生，我當時沒有控制好自己的情緒……但那畢竟是數百名維多利亞平民……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並非不能理解你的憤怒。但你想過嗎，如果我們不以最快速度撤離，讓“植根哥倫比亞”的黑鋼國際被某位大公爵發覺行蹤……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後會發生的事，放在兩個國家之間，叫“摩擦”與“衝突”。但落在普通人頭上，就叫“災難”與“浩劫”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說的很有道理，但我不明白……這和我們將要做的任務有什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在提醒你，不要再犯和維多利亞那時同樣的錯誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同樣的錯誤……您這是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"順便，拿著這個袋子，把裡面的東西交給達維鎮一位叫做伍德洛·比安奇的男性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是否有這位先生的詳細資料，比如長相和種族——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要，你去了一眼就能認出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……克里夫先生，我還是不明白，僅僅是修理動力爐，為什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提醒你一句，潔西卡，你是傭兵，你的任務只是生意，不是義務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“橋夾”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"潔西卡拈起從袋子裡倒出的子彈，對準陽光仔細端詳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突緣彈、點44口徑……底下還刻著花紋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行……太模糊了，什麼也看不清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩科塔的子彈……看起來和黑鋼的蝕刻彈也沒什麼差別……"},{"type":"narration","text":"彈殼鏽跡斑斑，表面的銅色發棕，即使有強光照射也難見光澤。\n潔西卡嘆了口氣，把子彈裝回袋中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“犯和維多利亞那時同樣的錯誤”……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達維鎮到底怎麼了？"},{"type":"narration","text":"忽然，她聽見了風雪以外的聲音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別亂動，小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也不想挨子彈吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
